      180  == Education {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      181  In Ocnița District are 32 educational institutions operating: in schools – 5482 children in agro-college – 242 in polyvalent [[vocational school]]s – 196. Currently in educational institutions operating in the district 652 teachers. After the 2010 education reform is proposed to open more [[grammar 
      182  == Culture {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      183  The district Ocnița has six museums, 153 artistic works, 15 bands holding the title of the band model, 30 public libraries.
      184  == Health {{Citation needed|reason=Not in 2024 Census Data|date=February 2026}} ==
      185  The district Ocnița has two hospitals with general fund of 200 beds, a center of family doctors in the composition of which are 20 family physician offices, six health centers, a medical point. In Health Care operates 96 doctors, 322 personal care environment, 218 and auxiliary medical personnel.
